{"as_of_turn_id":"t054","checkpoint_id":"med_episode_rewrite_en_001_early_pregnancy_confidential_contact_ckpt_01","context_complete":true,"episode_id":"med_episode_rewrite_en_001_early_pregnancy_confidential_contact","input_manifest":{"memory_ids":["enrichment:boundary:1:evolve:0:2","note:obs:med_episode_rewrite_en_001_early_pregnancy_confidential_contact:t049","note:obs:med_episode_rewrite_en_001_early_pregnancy_confidential_contact:t054","note:obs:med_episode_rewrite_en_001_early_pregnancy_confidential_contact:t051","note:obs:med_episode_rewrite_en_001_early_pregnancy_confidential_contact:t025","note:obs:med_episode_rewrite_en_001_early_pregnancy_confidential_contact:t024","note:obs:med_episode_rewrite_en_001_early_pregnancy_confidential_contact:t052","note:obs:med_episode_rewrite_en_001_early_pregnancy_confidential_contact:t053","note:obs:med_episode_rewrite_en_001_early_pregnancy_confidential_contact:t048","note:obs:med_episode_rewrite_en_001_early_pregnancy_confidential_contact:t026","note:obs:med_episode_rewrite_en_001_early_pregnancy_confidential_contact:t023","note:obs:med_episode_rewrite_en_001_early_pregnancy_confidential_contact:t050"],"query_scope":"authenticated-requester-only"},"output":{"action":"answer","answer":"For pain, use acetaminophen 650 mg every 6 hours as needed, with a maximum of 3,000 mg per day. For nausea, start doxylamine 12.5 mg at bedtime and pyridoxine 25 mg twice daily. Stop ibuprofen completely. Continue your prenatal vitamin and levothyroxine 75 mcg daily.","answer_structured":{"continue_medication":["prenatal vitamin","levothyroxine 75 mcg daily"],"nausea_medication":[{"dose":"12.5 mg","frequency":"at bedtime","name":"doxylamine"},{"dose":"25 mg","frequency":"twice daily","name":"pyridoxine"}],"pain_medication":{"dose":"650 mg","frequency":"every 6 hours as needed","max_daily_dose":"3,000 mg","name":"acetaminophen"},"stop_medication":["ibuprofen"]},"retrieved_memory":[{"memory_id":"enrichment:boundary:1:evolve:0:2","text":"Medication plan after initial clinician review: stop ibuprofen; use acetaminophen 650 mg q6h PRN with 3,000 mg/day max; continue prenatal vitamin and levothyroxine 75 mcg daily; start doxylamine 12.5 mg nightly and pyridoxine 25 mg BID.\nPost-clinician review medication regimen: Discontinue ibuprofen. Prescribe acetaminophen 650mg q6h PRN (max 3g/day) for pain. Continue prenatal vitamin and levothyroxine 75mcg. Initiate doxylamine 12.5mg nightly and pyridoxine 25mg BID for nausea."},{"memory_id":"note:obs:med_episode_rewrite_en_001_early_pregnancy_confidential_contact:t049","text":"For pain, use acetaminophen instead: 650 milligrams every six hours as needed, and keep the total under 3,000 milligrams in a day."},{"memory_id":"note:obs:med_episode_rewrite_en_001_early_pregnancy_confidential_contact:t054","text":"Medication plan after initial clinician review: stop ibuprofen; use acetaminophen 650 mg q6h PRN with 3,000 mg/day max; continue prenatal vitamin and levothyroxine 75 mcg daily; start doxylamine 12.5 mg nightly and pyridoxine 25 mg BID."},{"memory_id":"note:obs:med_episode_rewrite_en_001_early_pregnancy_confidential_contact:t051","text":"How much nausea are you having?"},{"memory_id":"note:obs:med_episode_rewrite_en_001_early_pregnancy_confidential_contact:t025","text":"Any medication allergies or reactions?"},{"memory_id":"note:obs:med_episode_rewrite_en_001_early_pregnancy_confidential_contact:t024","text":"I'm taking a prenatal vitamin and levothyroxine 75 micrograms each morning. I also took ibuprofen last night before the ED visit."},{"memory_id":"note:obs:med_episode_rewrite_en_001_early_pregnancy_confidential_contact:t052","text":"Mostly morning nausea, no vomiting, but it has been getting more noticeable this week."},{"memory_id":"note:obs:med_episode_rewrite_en_001_early_pregnancy_confidential_contact:t053","text":"Let's start doxylamine 12.5 milligrams at bedtime and pyridoxine 25 milligrams twice a day."},{"memory_id":"note:obs:med_episode_rewrite_en_001_early_pregnancy_confidential_contact:t048","text":"Understood. Elena, because of the bleeding, I want you to stop ibuprofen completely."},{"memory_id":"note:obs:med_episode_rewrite_en_001_early_pregnancy_confidential_contact:t026","text":"Sulfa antibiotics give me a blotchy rash."},{"memory_id":"note:obs:med_episode_rewrite_en_001_early_pregnancy_confidential_contact:t023","text":"Let's review medications before Dr. Shah comes in."},{"memory_id":"note:obs:med_episode_rewrite_en_001_early_pregnancy_confidential_contact:t050","text":"Continue your prenatal vitamin and continue levothyroxine 75 micrograms every morning."}],"used_record_ids":["enrichment:boundary:1:evolve:0:2","note:obs:med_episode_rewrite_en_001_early_pregnancy_confidential_contact:t054","note:obs:med_episode_rewrite_en_001_early_pregnancy_confidential_contact:t049","note:obs:med_episode_rewrite_en_001_early_pregnancy_confidential_contact:t053","note:obs:med_episode_rewrite_en_001_early_pregnancy_confidential_contact:t048","note:obs:med_episode_rewrite_en_001_early_pregnancy_confidential_contact:t050"]}}
